      "cooked": "<p>Hi,</p>\n<p>it may help to say the hosting environment, how Frappe/Erpnext was installed and whether this is happening on first use or if PDF generation was working at one time.</p>\n<p>wkhtmltppdf generally works OOB when standard installation method is used, the error suggests a permission error that may be traceable to the method used to install the apps.</p>",
